/p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.430" end="01:52.230"><span begin="01:50.430" end="01:50.610">You </span><span begin="01:50.610" end="01:50.760">ain't </span><span begin="01:50.760" end="01:50.940">never </span><span begin="01:50.940" end="01:51.210">seen </span><span begin="01:51.210" end="01:51.540">nothing </span><span begin="01:51.540" end="01:51.990">crazier </span><span begin="01:51.990" end="01:52.230">than</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.350" end="01:54.180"><span begin="01:52.350" end="01:52.650">This </span><span begin="01:52.650" end="01:52.890">nigga </span><span begin="01:52.890" end="01:53.070">when </span><span begin="01:53.070" end="01:53.190">he </span><span begin="01:53.190" end="01:53.400">off </span><span begin="01:53.400" end="01:53.520">his </span><span begin="01:53.520" end="01:54.180">Lexapro</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.270" end="01:56.220"><span begin="01:54.270" end="01:54.600">Remember </span><span begin="01:54.600" end="01:54.810">that </span><span begin="01:54.810" end="01:55.080">last </span><span begin="01:55.080" end="01:55.350">time </span><span begin="01:55.350" end="01:55.440">in </span><span begin="01:55.440" end="01:56.100">Mexico</span><span begin="01:56.100" end="01:56.220">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.220" end="01:58.140"><span begin="01:56.220" end="01:56.520">Remember </span><span begin="01:56.520" end="01:56.730">that </span><span begin="01:56.730" end="01:57.030">last </span><span begin="01:57.030" end="01:57.270">time</span><span begin="01:57.270" end="01:57.270">, </span><span begin="01:57.270" end="01:57.390">the </span><span begin="01:57.390" end="01:58.020">episode</span><span begin="01:58.020" end="01:58.140">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.140" end="02:00.030"><span begin="01:58.140" end="01:58.500">Asking </span><span begin="01:58.500" end="01:58.680">me </span><span begin="01:58.680" end="01:58.860">why </span><span begin="01:58.860" end="01:58.950">the </span><span 